{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermondeKeystone","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermondeKeystone","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Vandermonde"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.interp_leadingCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.interp_leadingCoeff","kind":"theorem","line":226,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L226-L244","doc":"**The keystone**, matching the type of `SYTLagrangeInterp.interp_leadingCoeff` (PR #2986):\nthe divided-difference combination of `f` over the nodes returns its leading coefficient\n`f.coeff k` whenever `f.natDegree ≤ k`.  Proved by linearity from `powSum`, no interpolation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.powSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.powSum","kind":"theorem","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L211-L224","doc":"**Power-sum form of the keystone.** `∑ᵢ (βᵢ)ᵈ / vWeightᵢ = [d = k]` for `d ≤ k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.vandermonde_det_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.vandermonde_det_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L203-L209","doc":"`det (vandermonde β) ≠ 0` for injective nodes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.cof_mul_vWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.cof_mul_vWeight","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L181-L199","doc":"**The Vandermonde cofactor product-split (crux).**  `cofᵢ · vWeightᵢ = det V`.\n\nThe cofactor along the last column is `(−1)^(i+k) · det(V.submatrix iᵒ lastᵒ)`, and that submatrix\nis `vandermonde (β ∘ i.succAbove)` (nodes with `βᵢ` deleted).  Combine with\n`det_vandermonde_pivot_split`; the signs match because `(−1)^(i+k) = (−1)^(k−i)` (`i ≤ k`).\n\nThis is the heart of the determinant route; it replaces the sibling's hand-rolled\n`SYTLagrangeInterp.interp_leadingCoeff` (PR #2986). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.det_vandermonde_pivot_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.det_vandermonde_pivot_split","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L167-L179","doc":"**The cofactor product-split, product form.**  `det V = (−1)^(k−i) · det(V₋ᵢ) · vWeightᵢ`,\nwhere `V₋ᵢ = vandermonde (β ∘ i.succAbove)` is the Vandermonde with node `βᵢ` deleted.  Split\n`det_vandermonde`'s pair product at the pivot row `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.pivot_contribution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.pivot_contribution","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L134-L165","doc":"The pivot-row contribution: `(∏_{q>i}(β q − β i)) · (∏_{a : σa<i}(β i − β σa)) = (−1)^(k−i) ·\nvWeightᵢ`.  The above-pivot product flips sign on each of its `k − i` factors, and the two\nhalf-products reassemble `vWeightᵢ = ∏_{j≠i}(β i − β j)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.inner_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.inner_split","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L114-L132","doc":"The inner `Ioi (i.succAbove a)` Vandermonde-difference product splits into the sub-Vandermonde\nfactor (over `Ioi a`) and the single pivot factor `(β i − β (i.succAbove a))` present iff\n`i.succAbove a < i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.succAbove_image_Ioi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.succAbove_image_Ioi","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L101-L112","doc":"The `succAbove` image of `Ioi a` is `Ioi (i.succAbove a)` with the pivot `i` removed: the\nnodes above `βᵢ`-image among `q ≠ i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.detAmat_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.detAmat_lt","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L87-L93","doc":"For `d < k`, `Amat` has two equal columns (`d` and the last) so its determinant vanishes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.Amat_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.Amat_top","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L80-L85","doc":"At `d = k` the modified Vandermonde is the Vandermonde itself. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.detAmat_laplace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.detAmat_laplace","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L68-L78","doc":"**Laplace expansion of `Amat` along the last column.** `det (Amat β d) = ∑ᵢ cofᵢ · (βᵢ)ᵈ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.cof","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.cof","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L64-L66","doc":"The cofactor of the Vandermonde along the last column at row `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.Amat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.Amat","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L60-L62","doc":"The Vandermonde with its last column `(β i)^k` replaced by `(β i)^d`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.vWeight_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.vWeight_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L50-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.vWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTVandermonde.vWeight","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTVandermondeKeystone.lean#L45-L48","doc":"The Vandermonde / divided-difference weight `Dᵢ = ∏_{j ≠ i}(βᵢ − βⱼ)` (matches\n`SYTLagrangeInterp.vWeight`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}